  m_text: "An imported mesh can be shown and placed, but ProBuilder cannot edit it. Pro Builderize converts it into a ProBuilder mesh, with faces, edges and vertices to select. The file in the Project stays as it was: the scene object now holds its own copy.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You Pro Builderize this bench and delete one of its faces. Does the Bench file in the Project window change?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Bench and use Tools \u203A ProBuilder \u203A Object \u203A Pro Builderize.\n2. In Face mode, delete one face.\n3. Drag Bench from the Imports folder in again and compare.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Good-And-Bad-Meshes 1 \xB7 Open faces</color></size>"
