  m_text: 'Ready-made assets can be used when their licence allows it. CC0 asks for nothing; CC-BY asks for credit to the author. Keep each asset in your library with its source and licence written down, so the credits travel with the project. AI-generated assets are allowed too.


    <b>Predict:</b> You use a CC-BY model in your scene. What must your project include?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Open the asset library''s Third Party Notices.md and read two entries.

    2. Find a CC0 model on Poly Haven (Models).

    3. Write its author, source and licence in your own credits file.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: the asset library''s Third Party Notices.md</color></size>'
